== a12_returnexisting
  san:    exit 0 returnexisting 1|returnexisting 12|
  O3:     exit 0 returnexisting 1|returnexisting 12|
  interp: exit 0 returnexisting 1|returnexisting 12|
--- compile (-debug -sanitize)
built ./build/a12_returnexisting.debug.san
--- run san
returnexisting 1
returnexisting 12
--- run O3
returnexisting 1
returnexisting 12
--- interpret
returnexisting 1
returnexisting 12
